% Flight Plan example with errors; Common mistakes and plenty of comments
  Great for learning what *NOT* to do in AirLang! %


 7aircraft   	  ^^ Nothing can start with num, not id not variable nothing. 

 -77               ^^Valid int (-ve)
 ETA: 1.5.7;       ^^ Invalid float

Weather clear        ^^ERROR: clear is not within quotes so not a string. doesn't start with UpperCase so not ID, hence Nothing. 
	Clear        ^^correct id starting Caps 
       "rain"        ^^correct string, both double qoutes
	Rain()       ^^correct MNID , both parantheses


MAIN {               ^^correct keyword all caps predefined in kwd table
    

	    AircraftId C-ZEGL     ^^ absolutely correct for aircraftId 
	    	       ZS-EGL;     ^^ eehhh... Zulu Sierra Echo Golf Limaaa!!!  
	               ZSEGL      ^^ hehe had to keep this atleast a valid ID 	
            Type "B747"           ^^ nothing should be wrong with aircraft type 
            FuelCapacity 77abc    ^^ Invalid number
	    Date  '2025-06-24'    ^^ correct date within single qoutes
 	          '24-06-2025'    ^^ same correct     
	          2025/06/24      ^^ERROR: not in single quotes [Don't have token for /]

        }
        
        FLIGHT {  
	    FlightNumber AL777   ^^ correct flight ID 2 letters + 3 digits
	     		 ABC77   ^^ NOPE will go to normal ID not FlightID specifically
                         AL7774  ^^ Noo same as above
                        
        }
            PRINT "Flight delayed; ^^ missing quote
	    Done finally!
             

